====Definitions====
{{head|zh|hanzi}}

# to [[have]]; to [[possess]] {{gl|when a subject is present}}
#: {{zh-x|我 有 兩 輛 車。|I '''have''' two cars.}}
#: {{zh-x|大象 有-著[着]{zhe} 長-長 的 鼻子{zi}。|Elephants '''have''' long trunks.}}
#*: {{zh-x|甘橘，^大厘 城 有 之，其 味 酸。|Dali City '''has''' sweet tangerines, but their flavour is sour.|CL|ref={{RQ:Manshu|7|Tea, Trees, Herbs and Fruits|7}}}}
# [[there is]]; to [[exist]] {{gl|when a subject is absent}}
#: {{zh-x|有 很 多 人。|'''There are''' a lot of people.}}
#: {{zh-x|這兒{r} 有 書 嗎？|'''Are there''' any books here?}}
#: {{zh-x|這裡 有-著[着]{zhe} 清新 的 空氣。|'''There is''' fresh air here.}}
#: {{zh-x|「^陳 ^小明 同學！」「^有！」|"Is [[John Doe]] here?" "'''Present'''!" ''(scene of [[take roll|taking roll]] at a classroom)''}}
# (to certain extent)
#: {{zh-x|這 條 繩子 有 兩 米 長。|This rope is two meters long.}}
#: {{zh-x|有 這麼 貴 嗎？|Is it really that expensive?}}
# {{lb|zh|euphemistic}} to be [[pregnant]] with a child
# [[abundant]]; [[affluent]]
# [[many]]; [[much]]; {{lb|zh|of time}} [[long]]; {{lb|zh|of age}} [[old]]
# [[some]] {{gl|indefinite pronoun}}
# {{lb|zh|literary|or|dialectal}} {{n-g|Placed before a verb to emphasize that the action has been done.}}
#: {{zh-x|古語 有 云|as the saying goes|lit=the old saying '''has''' said|CL}}
#: {{zh-x|伊 拄才{chiah} 有{ū} 出來。|He '''did''' come just now.|MN|tr=I tú-chiah '''ū''' chhut-lâi.}}
#: {{zh-x|我 有 去 過 海洋 公園{jyun4-2}。|I '''have''' been to {{w|Ocean Park}}.|C|tr=ngo5 '''jau5''' heoi3 gwo3 hoi2 joeng4 gung1 jyun4-2.}}
#: {{zh-x|我 有 看見 過 他。|I '''have''' seen him.}}
# {{surname|zh}}
#: {{zh-x|^有子|Philosopher You}}
# {{n-g|A [[meaningless]] [[prefix]].}}
#: {{zh-x|有夏|China}}
# {{lb|zh|Hokkien|Teochew}} {{n-g|Particle used after a verb to indicate accomplishment or accomplishability of a goal.}}
#: {{zh-x|聽 有{ū}|to '''understand''' (when listening); to '''be able''' to hear|MN|tr=thiaⁿ '''ū'''}}
#: {{zh-x|揣 有|tr=cuê7 '''u6'''|to '''be able''' to find|MN-T}}
# {{zh-div|日}} {{lb|zh|telegraphy}} the [[twenty-fifth]] [[day]] of a [[month]]

